<title>UK: SIGMA FINANCE CORP SETS 100 MLN SWISS FRANC BOND.</title>
<headline>SIGMA FINANCE CORP SETS 100 MLN SWISS FRANC BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGMA FINANCE CORP, GRAND CAYMAN</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    22.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.30    PAY DATE    22.SEP.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    SWISS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CAY</p>
<p> CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
